# athena_sim build output and scratch state. The simulator's 16 MiB flash image
# and its save-states are per-developer working data, never committed.
build/
*.bin
*.state
src/sim/third_party/

# The root .gitignore drops every *.png; the regression goldens have to be
# tracked or tools/sim_regress.py has nothing to compare against, and the same
# goes for the source the macOS bundle's icon is built from.
!tests/golden/*.png
!src/sim/gui/appicon.png

# And it drops every *.uf2. The macOS bundle carries the firmware it boots, so
# without this exception the committed .app would have nothing to run.
!artifacts/sim/macos/*.app/Contents/Resources/firmware.uf2

# Likewise it drops every CMakeLists.txt (an upstream QMK rule aimed at the ones
# CLion generates). This one is the simulator's build definition -- without it a
# fresh clone cannot build athena_sim at all.
!src/sim/CMakeLists.txt
